"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1011608012:0":{"text":"ええと、つまり……あなたたちはイミルの味方じゃないってこと？","source_cn":"所以，听你们的意思……你们和伊米尔不是一伙的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BEA436FA9D76B80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1011608013:0":{"text":"我らはパリーサ様の部下である。長官が解任されたあと、我らもここに異動させられたのだ。","source_cn":"吾等是帕瑞莎部下。长官离任后，吾等被接连调职，下放于此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE895FE8DEF6B4848","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1011608014:1":{"text":"私のせいで、あなたたちまで巻き添えに……","source_cn":"我被革职，连你们也受牵连了吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0753ED1CF7B79890","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011608015:1":{"text":"我らが尽くすは茨。\n賢知なし賢者に、捧げる忠義なし！","source_cn":"吾等效忠荆棘。\\n贤者不贤，当然无忠可献！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DAF37B4D31718FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1011608016:1":{"text":"……あなたたちは、私よりも物事が良く見えているのね。","source_cn":"……好……你们看的比我透彻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF235C365568A06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1011608017:1":{"text":"長官、我が隊はこの近くに集結しております。ぜひ視察と休息にいらしてください！","source_cn":"长官，吾等已在附近重新集结，您可前往视察休憩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DA57E8E28F989F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1011608018:1":{"text":"ブラム、ロゼルタ、見つけた物資を持って、キャンプへ戻るぞ！","source_cn":"布拉苜，萝赛塔，收好寻到的物资，列队回营！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FCACED01E3CEFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"いや、気持ちだけで十分だ……","source_cn":"那倒是不用了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB51439B532C531","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"いや、気持ちだけで十分だ……","female":"いえ、気持ちだけで十分よ……","variant_male_record_index":"60528","variant_female_record_index":"60529","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1011608011:0":{"text":"ははっ！無礼をどうかお許しください！","source_cn":"是，恳请宽恕吾的无礼！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA81CC176A2CFE9B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ははっ！無礼をどうかお許しください！","female":"ははっ！無礼をどうかお許しください！","variant_male_record_index":"107227","variant_female_record_index":"107228","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"謝るなら今のうちだよ！","source_cn":"要好好向我道歉！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x440133A07A3E4F1D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"謝るなら今のうちだよ！","female":"謝るなら今のうちよ！","variant_male_record_index":"60530","variant_female_record_index":"60531","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn"